    32	 * @param numberOfParticipants - Number of participants in the chat. It should not include the current user.
    33	 * @param total - IOU total amount in backend format (cents, no matter the currency)
    34	 * @param currency - This is used to know how many decimal places are valid to use when splitting the total
    35	 * @param isDefaultUser - Whether we are calculating the amount for the current user
